    "description": "Closed for $1,298,554 equivalent with fees waived by CSO. Outer Richmond duplex conveniently located just steps from Golden Gate Park, Ocean Beach, Beach Chalet, Lands End, Safeway, both Cabrillo & Balboa Street restaurants & shops, Sutro Baths, and an array of local attractions & conveniences.  This mid-century pair of flats presents a similar floor plan in both units, comprising east-facing living and dining areas, kitchens, full baths, and two bedrooms side by side at the rear. The ground floor boasts a spacious garage with room for two cars side by side, offering ample space for potential expansion or an ADU addition. The mid-floor unit is vacant, providing an opportunity for new owners, while the top floor is currently occupied, generating $2,181 per month in rental income. Enjoy partial ocean views from this desirable property."
